orward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing LineEdit with Icon and Clear button enabled. Icon expand mode is set to `Fit to Text`, and both the icon the Clear button correctly reflects this size visually.\n\nHowever in-game, the Clear button's hitbox remains the same size as the imported texture. In my example the texture is 128px, LineEdit's font size is 16. The icon looks the same size as the text, but its clickable width is still 128 pixels.\n\nThis issue is similar to, but distinct from: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119735\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cea3e79-b119-41ef-9618-2a53ccf7f485\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n0. See video above, OR:\n1. Create a `LineEdit`. Leave the default font size (16 in my ver.)\n1. Parent it to a `PanelContainer` and resize it to be wide.\n1. Enable `Clear Button`, assign it a large texture. In my case, it's 128 x 128 px.\n1. Set `Icon Expand Mode` to `Fit to Text`.\n1. Assign a `Clear Icon`, also 128 x 128 px.\n1. Run the game, type some text into the LineEdit.\n1. Use the mouse to observe the hover area of the Clear button, it extends far to the left of the visual button.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124188/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124188/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}